   "purpose": "Show the scanner's own view: the world becomes black and white, a line steps through the real code's rows, and the strip below shows exactly what that row reads. When a row crosses a corner square the dark-light-dark-light-dark signature lights up and that square is marked; all three marked = 'where to look'.",
