   "purpose": "The scan 'decodes' into its origin story on bright paper: the camera tracks a tape-measure timeline that runs diagonally and lands on 1994 as it is spoken, the code is stamped onto it, then the camera drops to the letters QR as they unfold into the words they stand for.",
