   "purpose": "The square opens into a business form. A template of the nested-square pattern hunts the form and, for each square-ish feature it lands on, the run of dark and light the scanner would read is drawn beside the corner square's own: logo, table cell and checkbox each fail to match. Then the team's words appear verbatim.",
