   "purpose": "The survey made concrete: prints are thrown onto the table, a scan bar reads them and their runs pile up into a ledger; a search head slides along every row and finds nothing, until 'the rarest' ratio drops in and matches. Then the corner pattern alone measures exactly 1:1:3:1:1.",
