   "purpose": "Prove the payoff: the code grows back around the pattern as the lights go down, then turns to different angles while the line through the corner keeps reading exactly 1:1:3:1:1. Three found corners plus the empty one fix which way is up; the code settles upright. The last half second dissolves back to the photographed code, closing the loop on frame 0.",
